    "description": "The Telecom Sim Swap API facilitates the batch processing of SIM card swaps, enabling telecommunications providers to efficiently manage customer requests for SIM exchanges. This endpoint allows for multiple SIM swap operations to be executed in a single request, streamlining the workflow for service agents. Typical consumers of this API include customer service teams and telecom system integrators managing customer accounts. By using this API, businesses can enhance service delivery and reduce processing time for customer requests.",
